Ram0 Supermemory distribution
Copyright 2026 Ram0 contributors

This repository is based on the Supermemory project and retains its MIT
license and upstream history. Ram0-owned changes provide a local gateway,
Model Context Protocol service, migration tooling, agent integrations, and
self-hosted deployment assets. Modified upstream source files identify the
fork in a short header and are traceable through repository history.

The self-hosted supermemory-server executable is downloaded from official
Supermemory GitHub releases during the engine image build. It is not source code from this repository. Its exact version and SHA-256 digest are pinned in
deploy/supermemory/Dockerfile.engine.

The Supermemory source tree is MIT licensed, but the downloaded engine release
asset does not publish sufficiently explicit asset-specific redistribution
terms. Ram0 does not assert a license for that binary. Images containing it are
kept private pending written clarification from Supermemory.
